#. module: boss_pricing_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:boss_pricing_sale.field_sale_order_line__boss_pricing_mode
msgid ""
"Supplier tariff: the cost is computed from approved supplier tariffs.\n"
"Manual amount: a person enters the cost of each shipment (freight offer, amount paid on behalf of the customer...).\n"
"BOSS own fee: no supplier cost.\n"
"Pending business decision: the service exists but is not priced until the open question is answered."
msgstr ""
"Tarifa de proveedor: el coste se calcula con tarifas de proveedor aprobadas.\n"
"Importe manual: una persona indica el coste de cada envío (oferta de flete, suplido...).\n"
"Honorario propio de BOSS: sin coste de proveedor.\n"
"Pendiente de decisión de negocio: el servicio existe pero no se cotiza hasta responder la pregunta abierta."

