#. module: boss_pricing_sale
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:boss_pricing_sale.boss_reprice_wizard_view_form
msgid ""
"The accepted prices stay in the pricing history; this change is recorded with its reason."
msgstr ""
"Los precios aceptados quedan en el historial; este cambio se registra con su motivo."

#. module: boss_pricing_sale
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:boss_pricing_sale.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"The chargeable weight is the higher of the gross weight and volume × factor of the mode (Ángel, 27/10/2026). A supplier document stating its own factor keeps it."
msgstr ""
"El peso tasable es el mayor entre el peso bruto y el volumen × factor del modo (Ángel, 27/10/2026). Un documento de proveedor que indique su propio factor lo conserva."

#. module: boss_pricing_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:boss_pricing_sale.field_sale_order__boss_rate_quotation
msgid ""
"The customer asks for rates (per container of each size, per B/L...) without saying how many containers will ship: per-container services are priced for one unit of their size, the document shows unit rates and no total, and the containers are entered before acceptance (Ángel, 27/10/2026)."
msgstr ""
"El cliente pide tarifas (por contenedor de cada tamaño, por B/L...) sin decir cuántos contenedores enviará: los servicios por contenedor se cotizan para una unidad de su tamaño, el documento muestra tarifas unitarias sin total y los contenedores se introducen antes de aceptar (Ángel, 27/10/2026)."

#. module: boss_pricing_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:boss_pricing_sale.field_boss_supplier_price_wizard__price_by_container_type
msgid "The document prices this container type differently."
msgstr "El documento cotiza este tipo de contenedor de forma distinta."

#. module: boss_pricing_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:boss_pricing_sale.field_boss_shipment_route__boss_chargeable_kg
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:boss_pricing_sale.field_sale_order__boss_chargeable_kg
msgid ""
"The higher of the gross weight and the volume weight; suppliers charge on it and so does BOSS. Needs both measures. Air: used as the AWB weight until the AWB is known."
msgstr ""
"El mayor del peso bruto y el peso volumen; los proveedores cobran sobre él y BOSS también. Necesita las dos medidas. Aéreo: se usa como peso de la AWB hasta conocer la AWB."

#. module: boss_pricing_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:boss_pricing_sale.field_boss_shipment_route__boss_planned_date
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:boss_pricing_sale.field_sale_order__boss_planned_date
msgid ""
"The key date of the shipment: ETA for an import, ETD for an export, a cross-trade or a national shipment. It chooses the version of each supplier tariff."
msgstr ""
"La fecha clave del envío: ETA en importación, ETD en exportación, cruzado o nacional. Elige la versión de cada tarifa de proveedor."

#. module: boss_pricing_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/boss_pricing_sale/models/product_pricelist_item.py:0
msgid "The margin on sale must be between 0 and 100 %."
msgstr "El margen sobre la venta debe estar entre 0 y 100 %."

#. module: boss_pricing_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/boss_pricing_sale/models/sale_order_line.py:0
msgid "The minimum margin of %s per unit applies."
msgstr "Se aplica el margen mínimo de %s por unidad."

#. module: boss_pricing_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:boss_pricing_sale.field_sale_order__boss_margin_alert
msgid ""
"The minimum margin rules of Odoo 17 (Sales › Configuration › Minimum margins): by group of services and kind of shipment, with the customer exceptions; 10 % of the cost without a rule, 10 of tolerance; amounts paid on behalf re-invoiced exactly. Only services whose cost is known. A warning: nothing is blocked."
msgstr ""
"Las reglas de margen mínimo de Odoo 17 (Ventas › Configuración › Márgenes mínimos): por grupo de servicios y tipo de envío, con las excepciones de cliente; 10 % del coste sin regla, 10 de tolerancia; los suplidos se refacturan exactos. Solo servicios con coste conocido. Es un aviso: no bloquea nada."

#. module: boss_pricing_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/boss_pricing_sale/models/product_pricelist_item.py:0
msgid "The minimum margin should be lower than the maximum margin."
msgstr "El margen mínimo debe ser inferior al margen máximo."

#. module: boss_pricing_sale
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:boss_pricing_sale.constraint_boss_shipment_container_quantity_positive
msgid "The number of containers must be positive."
msgstr "El número de contenedores debe ser positivo."

#. module: boss_pricing_sale
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:boss_pricing_sale.boss_supplier_price_wizard_view_form
msgid ""
"The price is saved in a supplier tariff (never on the quotation), with its route and validity. Earlier prices stay as history: the newest one valid on the tariff date is used."
msgstr ""
"El precio se guarda en una tarifa de proveedor (nunca en la oferta), con su ruta y validez. Los precios anteriores quedan como historial: se usa el más reciente válido en la fecha de tarifa."

#. module: boss_pricing_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:boss_pricing_sale.field_boss_pricing_test__simulated
msgid ""
"The price used is not approved: the result is a simulation, not usable in quotations until the tariff is approved."
msgstr ""
"El precio usado no está aprobado: el resultado es una simulación, no utilizable en ofertas hasta que se apruebe la tarifa."

#. module: boss_pricing_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:boss_pricing_sale.field_boss_supplier_price_wizard__foreign_port_ids
msgid ""
"The route of this price: origin port of an import, destination port of an export. Empty: any."
msgstr ""
"La ruta de este precio: puerto de origen de una importación, de destino de una exportación. Vacío: cualquiera."

#. module: boss_pricing_sale
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:boss_pricing_sale.boss_margin_family_view_form
msgid ""
"The rules give the minimum margin of\n"
"                        these services together, by kind of shipment; without a rule, the % above (or 10 %). A margin up to\n"
"                        10 below the minimum is accepted."
msgstr ""
"Las reglas dan el margen mínimo de estos servicios juntos, por tipo de envío; sin regla, el % de arriba (o el 10 %). Se acepta un margen hasta 10 por debajo del mínimo."

#. module: boss_pricing_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:boss_pricing_sale.field_boss_sale_sailing__chosen
msgid ""
